t would've required a bunch of work to be done to ensure the security of the program.\nFinally, an update system has been made where after each launch, the version.txt file is compared to the one found in the Github master branch, if a difference is found a new \"update released\" window that prompts the user to click yes to go to the latest release or no to stay on the current version they have.", "created_at": "2024-11-17T01:07:28Z", "repo": "PS-SMD-Tools", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "82fc9fc290d0e13bc5cf1286a25d4a72f76aa391", "message": "Friendship has ended with Nuitka\n\nFriendship with PyInstaller has been reinstated.", "created_at": "2024-10-15T11:49:50Z", "repo": "PS-SMD-Tools", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d0f21c5b259c3c45bb243f99e637d35e4c6597d5", "message": "Reworked GUI\n\nReworked the GUI so it doesn't look messed up between Windows & Linux. Added an 'About' Section, version text and work has begun on getting a proper 1.0 release!", "created_at": "2024-10-14T11:36:18Z", "repo": "PS-SMD-Tools", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "32a1bed13fdabed1ffbb03ac60076a86c745fd58", "message": "Delete cache as it will be ignored", "created_at": "2024-09-07T09:35:19Z", "repo": "PS-SMD-Tools", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "29035227b8f2e8fea8b4f5f277ef8b42d5d03468", "message": "Create LICENSE", "created_at": "2024-09-07T09:31:57Z", "repo": "PS-SMD-Tools", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6d56e1fb55216712fa1590d3c88299673ec7942d", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/PostScriptReal/PS-SMD-Tools", "created_at": "2024-09-07T09:25:12Z", "repo": "PS-SMD-Tools", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7dd5e9cb169e587d0d9af66962e86a686946fcf2", "message": "Add Version Number", "created